<title>USA: Lilly Industries Inc Q2 net rises.</title>
<headline>Lilly Industries Inc Q2 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>(In thousands, except per share)</p>
<p>			    Three Months Ended     Six Months Ended</p>
<p>				    May 31,		   May 31,</p>
<p>				  1997	1996	 1997	1996</p>
<p> Net sales		$154,238  $131,711    $296,398 $204,982</p>
<p>Cost of products</p>
<p>   sold		     95,045    84,237     185,157  133,447</p>
<p>Selling, administrative</p>
<p>    and general	   36,062    28,585	70,063   43,454</p>
<p>Research and</p>
<p>   development	     4,656     4,618	 9,251    7,790</p>
<p> Restructuring charge     ---     9,607	   ---    9,607</p>
<p> Operating income	 18,475     4,664	31,927   10,684</p>
<p> Net Income		  7,401	 616	12,111    4,102</p>
<p>Average shares</p>
<p>  outstanding	     23,400    23,000	23,400   23,000</p>
<p> Net income per share	.32	 .03	   .52	.18</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago second quarter earnings before restructuring charge were $0.26 a share. Restructuring charge reflects costs associated with closure of former Lilly facilities and related reductions in workforce.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
